Error [E0132]: `BigInt` and `Decimal` can't be mixed — got ``BigInt`` and ``Decimal``
  --> tests/ui/bigint_decimal_mix.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print(whole + cents)
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: precise numeric types never mix with fixed-width integers or floats without an explicit constructor
 Fix: convert explicitly with `to_string()` / `Decimal("…")` at a boundary
